<title>ITALY: Gross yields fall at Italian Btp bond auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yields fall at Italian Btp bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a third tranche of 3.5 trillion lire worth of three-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (Btp) with a 6.00 pct coupon, and a third tranche of 2.5 trillion lire of five-year Btps carrying a 6.25 pct coupon.</p>
<p>		     Jan 1, 2000   pvs	Jan 1, 2002	pvs</p>
<p> Net Yield	  5.19 pct    5.33	  5.46 pct	5.71</p>
<p> Gross Yield	5.96 pct    6.10	  6.28 pct	6.54</p>
<p> Assigned price 100.30	 99.95	100.25	   99.20</p>
<p> Bids	     7.520 trln lire	   4.173 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	 3.500 trln lire	   2.500 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparisons are with a previous auction on January 2.</p>
</text>
